<div data-cgap-sector="Venues, Parks &amp; Attractions" data-cgap-term="park"></div><p class="lead">Parks, ranges and venues are full of people who have never been there before. A Gun Range sign at the gate, a Deep Water Drop Off sign at the shoreline and a lightning warning at the field do more than any rule sheet, because they stand right where the hazard is.</p><p>This page covers shooting ranges and hunting land, lakes, reservoirs and ponds, rides and attractions, stage rigging and arenas, pools and water parks, animal exhibits, and weather and wildfire warnings. Every sign is 8x12 rust-resistant aluminum with UV-stable print, made to live outside.</p><h2>What to post, and where</h2><div class="il-areas"><div class="il-area il-best"><h3>Most ordered</h3><p>The signs customers in this industry order most.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-gun-range-sign-live-firing-in-progress-do-not-enter-8x12-rust-resistant-aluminum-uv-resistant-outdoor-safety-sign-pre-drilled-for-easy-mounting-by-cgap-safety">Gun Range</a></li><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-reservoir-bank-edge-unstable-erosion-risk-and-fall-hazard-safety-sign-8x12-rust-resistant-aluminum-with-uv-resistant-graphics-by-cgap-safety">Reservoir Bank Edge</a></li><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/cgap-safety-danger-toxic-blue-green-algae-sign-8x12-in-aluminum-harmful-algal-bloom-water-safety-sign-for-lakes-ponds-parks">Toxic Blue-Green Algae</a></li><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/cgap-safety-danger-hunting-shooting-area-nearby-sign-eye-ear-protection-required-8x12-aluminum-outdoor-warning-sign-rust-proof-uv-resistant-pre-drilled">Hunting/Shooting Area Nearby</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Shooting ranges and hunting land</h3><p>Live fire warnings, firing lines and range perimeters. 45 signs. Typical spot: Mount on the trap service access door or the wall beside the trap, visible from the work position.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-gun-range-sign-live-firing-in-progress-do-not-enter-8x12-rust-resistant-aluminum-uv-resistant-outdoor-safety-sign-pre-drilled-for-easy-mounting-by-cgap-safety">Gun Range</a></li><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/cgap-safety-danger-hunting-shooting-area-nearby-sign-eye-ear-protection-required-8x12-aluminum-outdoor-warning-sign-rust-proof-uv-resistant-pre-drilled">Hunting/Shooting Area Nearby</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-bullet-trap-backplate-sign-cgap-w03433-812">Bullet Trap Backplate</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-gun-range-door-sign-cgap-c21280-812">Gun Range Door</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Lakes, reservoirs and ponds</h3><p>Shorelines, swimming areas and water quality warnings. 17 signs. Typical spot: Mount at eye level at the snowmaking pond intake walkway, on the post at the start of the walkway to the pond intake.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-reservoir-bank-edge-unstable-erosion-risk-and-fall-hazard-safety-sign-8x12-rust-resistant-aluminum-with-uv-resistant-graphics-by-cgap-safety">Reservoir Bank Edge</a></li><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-deep-water-drop-off-sign-drowning-hazard-no-swimming-keep-back-aluminum-12x8-uv-resistant-rust-resistant-by-cgap-safety">Deep Water Drop Off</a></li><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/cgap-safety-danger-toxic-blue-green-algae-sign-8x12-in-aluminum-harmful-algal-bloom-water-safety-sign-for-lakes-ponds-parks">Toxic Blue-Green Algae</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-snowmaking-pond-intake-walkway-sign-cgap-c10026-812">Snowmaking Pond Intake Walkway</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Rides and attractions</h3><p>Ride entrances, queues and maintenance areas. 203 signs. Typical spot: Track gates.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-go-kart-track-sign-8x12-aluminum">Go-Kart Track</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-coaster-transfer-track-sign-cgap-w00602-812">Coaster Transfer Track</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-ride-sump-pit-sign-cgap-c06525-812">Ride Sump Pit</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-ride-tool-crib-sign-cgap-n09285-812">Ride Tool Crib</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Stage rigging and arenas</h3><p>Rigging, catwalks, pit lifts and overhead loads. 275 signs. Typical spot: Mount it on the truss rack bay wall at shin to hip height.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/stadium-rigging-overhead-load-path-falling-equipment-danger-safety-sign-8x12-rust-resistant-aluminum-with-uv-resistant-graphics-by-cgap-safety">Stadium Rigging Overhead Load Path</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-press-box-catwalk-sign-cgap-w18952-812">Press Box Catwalk</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-truss-end-plate-sign-cgap-c03092-812">Truss End Plate</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-rigging-cage-sign-cgap-n07537-812">Rigging Cage</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Pools and water parks</h3><p>Pools, wave pools, slides and splash pads. 176 signs. Typical spot: Pool deck and gates.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-drained-pool-sign-8x12-aluminum">Drained Pool</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-wave-chamber-sign-cgap-w02208-812">Wave Chamber</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-wave-pool-ramp-sign-cgap-c20226-812">Wave Pool Ramp</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-wave-blower-vfd-sign-cgap-n15482-812">Wave Blower VFD</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Zoos and animal areas</h3><p>Keeper areas, gates and animal exhibits. 167 signs. Typical spot: Roof access ladder.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-aviary-mesh-roof-sign-8x12-aluminum">Aviary Mesh Roof</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-keeper-transfer-gate-sign-cgap-w05407-812">Keeper Transfer Gate</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-keeper-aisle-sign-cgap-c23207-812">Keeper Aisle</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-exhibit-sump-sign-cgap-n19656-812">Exhibit Sump</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Weather and wildfire</h3><p>Lightning, storm and wildfire warnings. 3 signs. Typical spot: Mount it on the operations office wall, in plain view of the person using the equipment.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/cgap-safety-danger-extreme-wildfire-risk-sign-8x12-in-aluminum-no-open-flames-fire-danger-sign-for-campgrounds-rural-properties">Extreme Wildfire Risk</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-ride-lightning-closure-log-sign-cgap-n06120-812">Ride Lightning Closure Log</a></li><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/cgap-safety-danger-high-risk-of-lightning-strike-sign-during-thunderstorms-8-12-aluminum-outdoor-electrical-hazard-warning-sign">High Risk of Lightning Strike</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Mechanical and maintenance areas</h3><p>Hydraulic units, hoists and back-of-house work. 200 signs. Typical spot: Doors to hoist rooms and hoist galleries.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-stage-hoist-room-sign-8x12-aluminum">Stage Hoist Room</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-scoreboard-hoist-sign-cgap-w02205-812">Scoreboard Hoist</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-winch-room-pipe-sign-cgap-c10430-812">Winch Room Pipe</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-hoist-load-cell-sign-cgap-n08007-812">Hoist Load Cell</a></li></ul></div></div><h2>Common questions</h2><div class="il-faq"><details><summary>What signs should a shooting range post?</summary><p>Typical postings are a live fire warning at every entrance, hearing and eye protection reminders at the firing line and keep out signs on the perimeter. Search &quot;gun range&quot; or &quot;shooting&quot; to see the options.</p></details><details><summary>Do you have signs for lakes and ponds?</summary><p>Yes, including deep water drop off, unstable bank edge and toxic blue-green algae warnings. Search &quot;deep water&quot; or &quot;algae&quot;.</p></details><details><summary>Will these signs fade outside?</summary><p>They are printed with UV-stable inks on rust-resistant aluminum, built for posts, fences and gates in full sun.</p></details></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "What signs should a shooting range post?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Typical postings are a live fire warning at every entrance, hearing and eye protection reminders at the firing line and keep out signs on the perimeter. Search \"gun range\" or \"shooting\" to see the options."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you have signs for lakes and ponds?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, including deep water drop off, unstable bank edge and toxic blue-green algae warnings. Search \"deep water\" or \"algae\"."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Will these signs fade outside?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "They are printed with UV-stable inks on rust-resistant aluminum, built for posts, fences and gates in full sun."}}]}</script>